; Drive-it-yourself rover on a flat lot with a ramp and a curb to bump over.
; No SITL needed: ←/→ steer, ↑/↓ throttle, R resets. Terrain following is on
; and the ground/ramps are on physics layer 1, so the wheels ride the real
; colliders — swap the lot for a GWTiles3DStreamer / GWImportedTerrain and it
; drives those the same way.
